&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:520,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:260,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;19&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You bring 10+ years of legal experience in pharmaceutical or biotech, with meaningful exposure to commercial operations, product launch, and cross-functional legal support — at a law firm, a company, or both. You have&amp;nbsp;operated&amp;nbsp;across multiple legal domains, not just one.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:50,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:50}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
